..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : ERLAUBNIS.SHOW.ALL.TIPPED
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : ba
.. Funktion       : Zeigt alle Erlaubnisse aller Tippkommandos.
.. Functionality  : Shows all permissions of all tipped commands.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.formula M|komindex = M|startindex
..
!NEXTTIP
.formula M|komindex = M|komindex + 1
.continue END ? M|komindex > G|maxkkomnam
.continue NEXTTIP ? F|regmatch((" " + M|tippausnahme + " "), (".* " + 'M|komindex' + " .*"))
.assign M|kdbkomnr = M|komindex
.assign M|kdbkomname = G|kkomname.M|komindex
.input "st/ERLAUBNIS.SHOW.PERMISSION"
.continue NEXTTIP
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
